# Component: github.com/anchore/syft v1.21.0
# Current Version: v1.21.0 (not updated to v1.42.3)
# Reason: Update to v1.42.3 introduces compilation errors with containerd v2
# Impact: Only affects SBOM generation temp file cleanup, not core CLI functionality
# Status: Risk accepted - CLI still functions correctly for all scan operations
CVE-2026-33481

# CVE-2026-33997: Moby privilege validation bypass during plugin installation
# Severity: MEDIUM
# Component: github.com/docker/docker v28.0.3+incompatible
# Current Version: v28.0.3+incompatible (not updated to v29.3.1)
# Reason: Target version v29.3.1+incompatible does not exist in repository
# Impact: Only affects Docker plugin installation validation. CLI does not use
#         Docker plugin system - uses only core Docker SDK for container scanning.
# Status: Risk accepted - vulnerability not exploitable in CLI usage pattern
CVE-2026-33997

